node_modules
# dist is intentionally TRACKED here (root .gitignore un-ignores
# trading-gui/dist/**): the GCP e2-micro is too small to run vite, so the
# built SPA must ship via the repo and serve after a plain pull. A local
# `dist` rule here silently overrode that exception — the 8/11 rebuild's
# renamed asset hashes were never committed and /terminal served a blank
# shell (index.html referencing missing assets/*.js).
*.local
.DS_Store
